<title>RUSSIA: Russia RTS index opens at record 363.81.</title>
<headline>Russia RTS index opens at record 363.81.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 22-share index opened at a record 363.81 at 11.00 a.m. (0700 GMT) on Monday, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
<p>The index closed on Friday at the previous record, 362.52, on strong market volume of $68.8 million.</p>
